---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Privacy Policy | Aetherexa Tools" description="How Aetherexa Tools handles files and data.">
  <section class="content" style="padding-top:70px;padding-bottom:100px;max-width:900px">
    <div class="section-eyebrow">PRIVACY FIRST</div>
    <h1 style="font-size:clamp(40px,6vw,68px);letter-spacing:-2px;margin:20px 0">Your files stay yours.</h1>
    <p style="color:#aac1d8;line-height:1.9;font-size:16px">Aetherexa Tools V1 runs utility transformations locally in your web browser. Text, CSV files, images, orders and price lists entered into the tools are processed on your device and are not uploaded to our servers.</p>
    <h2>What we collect</h2><p style="color:#9db0c9;line-height:1.8">The V1 application does not require an account and contains no product analytics, tracking cookies, or file-upload API. Your hosting provider may nevertheless collect technical access logs (for example, an IP address) when the website assets are requested.</p>
    <h2>Downloads and previews</h2><p style="color:#9db0c9;line-height:1.8">Files you create are downloaded directly by your browser. Preview data exists in page memory and can be cleared by reloading or closing the tab. Browser print functions are handled by your device and browser settings.</p>
    <h2>Third-party links</h2><p style="color:#9db0c9;line-height:1.8">External websites linked from our pages operate under their own privacy practices. We do not control their data collection.</p>
    <h2>Changes</h2><p style="color:#9db0c9;line-height:1.8">If analytics, ads, or remote integrations are introduced in later releases, this policy must be updated before launch and suitable disclosures and consent flows implemented where required.</p>
    <p style="margin-top:35px"><a href="/" class="btn ghost">← Back to tools</a></p>
  </section>
</Base>
